Tacit: elaboration-time enable for the DSC branch predictor (default on).

Generic; carried from the RiskyBird tacit fork (dd7a19c).

diff --git a/src/main/scala/DSCBranchPredictor.scala b/src/main/scala/DSCBranchPredictor.scala
